  "header": "h, VA 22042-4511 news.northropgrumman.com Northrop Grumman Reports First Quarter 2020 Financial Results | 14 SCHEDULE 4 NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION TOTAL BACKLOG (Unaudited) March\u00a031, 2020 | December\u00a031, 2019 | % Change in 2020 $ in millions | Funded 1 | Unfunded | Total Backlog 2 | Total Backlog 2",
